; The ending credits (BH2 Campaign): F major, 100 bpm, 44 bars (105 s). A flute states the theme over strings, a clarinet and harp carry it on, a bridge (Bb C Dm Gm) leads to the brass, and the full band builds to a held F major chord. The song loops softly back to the flute.
; Original notes; AW2's own voices; no rom lines.
